{"id":"3ae97efa23f80edf","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-dep-exists.md","title":"Dependent existential quantifier","display":"df-dependent-existential — Dependent existential quantifier","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-dep-exists","aliases":["16-df-dep-exists","Dependent existential quantifier"],"display":"df-dependent-existential — Dependent existential quantifier","depends_on":["[[16-df-display-map]]","[[16-df-comprehension-category]]","[[16-df-fibration]]","[[16-df-substitution]]","[[16-df-adjoint-functors]]"],"source":"Adjoint component of Definition 9.3.5(i) pp.540–541 (PDF560–561); §10.5 pp.624–625 (PDF644–645)","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-dep-exists"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-dep-exists</span><span>Dependent existential quantifier</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dependent-existential — Dependent existential quantifier"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"274c21b30aac62ac\" href=\"?note=274c21b30aac62ac\" title=\"16-df-display-map\">16-df-display-map</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0ba8f021ca287877\" href=\"?note=0ba8f021ca287877\" title=\"16-df-comprehension-category\">16-df-comprehension-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c9801f31ec8ac53f\" href=\"?note=c9801f31ec8ac53f\" title=\"16-df-fibration\">16-df-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ccfbb871fa39931c\" href=\"?note=ccfbb871fa39931c\" title=\"16-df-substitution\">16-df-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a88937ea87ff8530\" href=\"?note=a88937ea87ff8530\" title=\"16-df-adjoint-functors\">16-df-adjoint-functors</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Adjoint component of Definition 9.3.5(i) pp.540–541 (PDF560–561); §10.5 pp.624–625 (PDF644–645)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)\">\\(\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi X=(\\pi_X:\\{X\\}\\to pX)\">\\(\\chi X=(\\pi_X:\\{X\\}\\to pX)\\)</span>，采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0ba8f021ca287877\" href=\"?note=0ba8f021ca287877\" title=\"16-df-comprehension-category\">16-df-comprehension-category</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q:\\mathcal P\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(q:\\mathcal P\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 是同一基范畴上的带提升选择纤维化，采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c9801f31ec8ac53f\" href=\"?note=c9801f31ec8ac53f\" title=\"16-df-fibration\">16-df-fibration</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ccfbb871fa39931c\" href=\"?note=ccfbb871fa39931c\" title=\"16-df-substitution\">16-df-substitution</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_\\chi=\\mathrm{Disp}(p,\\chi)\">\\(D_\\chi=\\mathrm{Disp}(p,\\chi)\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"274c21b30aac62ac\" href=\"?note=274c21b30aac62ac\" title=\"16-df-display-map\">16-df-display-map</a> 的切片同构闭包；对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\in D_\\chi\">\\(d\\in D_\\chi\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_d=\\operatorname{dom}d\">\\(A_d=\\operatorname{dom}d\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_d=\\operatorname{cod}d\">\\(I_d=\\operatorname{cod}d\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d^*:\\mathcal P_{I_d}\\to\\mathcal P_{A_d}\">\\(d^*:\\mathcal P_{I_d}\\to\\mathcal P_{A_d}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>伴随及其自然 Hom 双射采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"a88937ea87ff8530\" href=\"?note=a88937ea87ff8530\" title=\"16-df-adjoint-functors\">16-df-adjoint-functors</a>。下文量词统一选择一族候选函子；其源靶由各 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 决定。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HasDepExists}(q,D_\\chi)\">\\(\\mathrm{HasDepExists}(q,D_\\chi)\\)</span> 是本页定义的最小伴随存在性质。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{HasDepExists}(q,D_\\chi)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\exists(\\Sigma_d)_{d\\in D_\\chi})\\Bigl[\n(\\forall d\\in D_\\chi)\\ \n\\Sigma_d:\\mathcal P_{A_d}\\to\\mathcal P_{I_d}\n\\land \\Sigma_d\\dashv d^*\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{HasDepExists}(q,D_\\chi)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\exists(\\Sigma_d)_{d\\in D_\\chi})\\Bigl[\n(\\forall d\\in D_\\chi)\\ \n\\Sigma_d:\\mathcal P_{A_d}\\to\\mathcal P_{I_d}\n\\land \\Sigma_d\\dashv d^*\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本页只定义沿显示类的左伴随存在性，没有额外要求换基 mate 可逆。Jacobs Definition 9.3.5 的完整 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi\">\\(\\chi\\)</span>-coproducts 还要求理解拉回的 Beck–Chevalley 条件；两者须区分。尤其本页谓词不能替代完整理解量词结构。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\cong_I\\pi_X\">\\(d\\cong_I\\pi_X\\)</span>，取切片同构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:A_d\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\{X\\}\">\\(a:A_d\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\{X\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_Xa=d\">\\(\\pi_Xa=d\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a^*\">\\(a^*\\)</span> 是等价函子，逆等价为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a^{-1})^*\">\\((a^{-1})^*\\)</span>，故沿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_X\">\\(\\pi_X\\)</span> 的伴随可以沿该等价运输到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span>。可取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_d\\cong\\Sigma_{\\pi_X}(a^{-1})^*\">\\(\\Sigma_d\\cong\\Sigma_{\\pi_X}(a^{-1})^*\\)</span>。因此与只沿实际理解投影要求伴随存在等价，但不是所有基态射都被纳入。</p>\n<p>原稿把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 的基写成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 却调用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> 中的显示箭头，且量词未限制显示类。本页固定共同基底和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_\\chi\">\\(D_\\chi\\)</span> 参数；所选伴随族始终处于同一存在量词作用域，不再把内部见证当成外部自由符号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-display-map","status":"resolved","id":"274c21b30aac62ac","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-display-map]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-comprehension-category","status":"resolved","id":"0ba8f021ca287877","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-comprehension-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"c9801f31ec8ac53f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"ccfbb871fa39931c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"a88937ea87ff8530","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-adjoint-functors]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-comprehension-category","status":"resolved","id":"0ba8f021ca287877","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)$，$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$，$\\chi X=(\\pi_X:\\{X\\}\\to pX)$，采用 [[16-df-comprehension-category]]。$q:\\mathcal P\\to\\mathcal B$ 是同一基范畴上的带提升选择纤维化，采用 [[16-df-fibration]]、[[16-df-substitution]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"c9801f31ec8ac53f","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)$，$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$，$\\chi X=(\\pi_X:\\{X\\}\\to pX)$，采用 [[16-df-comprehension-category]]。$q:\\mathcal P\\to\\mathcal B$ 是同一基范畴上的带提升选择纤维化，采用 [[16-df-fibration]]、[[16-df-substitution]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"ccfbb871fa39931c","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)$，$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$，$\\chi X=(\\pi_X:\\{X\\}\\to pX)$，采用 [[16-df-comprehension-category]]。$q:\\mathcal P\\to\\mathcal B$ 是同一基范畴上的带提升选择纤维化，采用 [[16-df-fibration]]、[[16-df-substitution]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-display-map","status":"resolved","id":"274c21b30aac62ac","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$D_\\chi=\\mathrm{Disp}(p,\\chi)$ 是 [[16-df-display-map]] 的切片同构闭包；对 $d\\in D_\\chi$，$A_d=\\operatorname{dom}d$、$I_d=\\operatorname{cod}d$，$d^*:\\mathcal P_{I_d}\\to\\mathcal P_{A_d}$。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"a88937ea87ff8530","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"伴随及其自然 Hom 双射采用 [[16-df-adjoint-functors]]。下文量词统一选择一族候选函子；其源靶由各 $d$ 决定。$\\mathrm{HasDepExists}(q,D_\\chi)$ 是本页定义的最小伴随存在性质。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)","display":false},{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi X=(\\pi_X:\\{X\\}\\to pX)","display":false},{"tex":"q:\\mathcal P\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"D_\\chi=\\mathrm{Disp}(p,\\chi)","display":false},{"tex":"d\\in D_\\chi","display":false},{"tex":"A_d=\\operatorname{dom}d","display":false},{"tex":"I_d=\\operatorname{cod}d","display":false},{"tex":"d^*:\\mathcal P_{I_d}\\to\\mathcal P_{A_d}","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HasDepExists}(q,D_\\chi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{HasDepExists}(q,D_\\chi)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\exists(\\Sigma_d)_{d\\in D_\\chi})\\Bigl[\n(\\forall d\\in D_\\chi)\\ \n\\Sigma_d:\\mathcal P_{A_d}\\to\\mathcal P_{I_d}\n\\land \\Sigma_d\\dashv d^*\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\chi","display":false},{"tex":"d\\cong_I\\pi_X","display":false},{"tex":"a:A_d\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\{X\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_Xa=d","display":false},{"tex":"a^*","display":false},{"tex":"(a^{-1})^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_X","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_d\\cong\\Sigma_{\\pi_X}(a^{-1})^*","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"D_\\chi","display":false}],"bytes":2475,"backlinks":[{"id":"bdce6096efa4097a","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"这是 [[16-df-dep-exists]] 在共同基底 $\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$ 上的实例：$p$ 取集合族的理解结构，$q$ 取幂集谓词纤维化，$\\pi_A$ 属于该理解显示类。原稿的 $P:\\Gamma.A\\to\\Omega$ 没有约束 $\\Omega$ 或真值解释；现以明确的子集谓词展开，不把任意高阶命题对象当成宿主布尔真值。"},{"id":"65f4c580e28f6048","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$(p,\\chi)$、$q:\\mathcal P\\to\\mathcal B$、$D_\\chi=\\mathrm{Disp}(p,\\chi)$ 采用 [[16-df-dep-exists]]；假设 $\\mathrm{HasDepExists}(q,D_\\chi)$ 并固定其同一伴随族。$d:A\\to I\\in D_\\chi$，$\\Sigma_d:\\mathcal P_A\\to\\mathcal P_I$ 为其中分量。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-168","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-dep-exists|df-dependent-existential — Dependent existential quantifier]]"},{"id":"e59beb3704642c3f","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$(p,\\chi)$、$q:\\mathcal P\\to\\mathcal B$、$D_\\chi=\\mathrm{Disp}(p,\\chi)$ 采用 [[16-df-dep-exists]]、[[16-df-dep-forall]] 的同基底结构。假设 $\\mathrm{HasDepExists}(q,D_\\chi)$ 与 $\\mathrm{HasDepForall}(q,D_\\chi)$，取各定义同一见证中的伴随族。"}],"outgoing":["274c21b30aac62ac","0ba8f021ca287877","c9801f31ec8ac53f","ccfbb871fa39931c","a88937ea87ff8530"]}